---
// Module 5: Functional Harmony. The seven diatonic chords sort into
// three roles — tonic, predominant, dominant — and the standard cadence
// arc walks T → PD → D → T. Substitutions within each function category
// produce variations that share an underlying tension shape.
import Module5Behold from './Module5Behold';
import Module5Derive from './Module5Derive';
import Module5Operate from './Module5Operate';
import Module5Prompts from './Module5Prompts';
---

<div class="m m5">
  <section class="m-block m5-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      The seven diatonic triads don't act independently. They group into
      three <em>roles</em>: tonic (home), predominant (pull away),
      dominant (lean back). The most common phrase shape walks through
      these in order — tonic, predominant, dominant, tonic — and the
      music feels closed when it lands back home.
    </p>
    <Module5Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m5-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      Tonic chords (I, vi, iii) stabilize. Predominants (IV, ii) set up
      tension. Dominants (V, vii°) want to resolve down a fifth — that's
      Module 2 again, the gcd(7, 12) = 1 motion underneath the most
      important cadential move. Click any chord to see its position in
      the function map.
    </p>
    <Module5Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m5-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      A four-slot progression with the function order locked. Within
      each slot, swap in a substitute: vi for the home, ii for the
      predominant, vii° for the dominant. Hit play and hear how the
      same arc holds while the surface chords change.
    </p>
    <Module5Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m5-block">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on function and cadence.
    </p>
    <Module5Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m-block m5-block m-bridge m5-bridge">
    <p class="m-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      Diatonic harmony gets a long way. Outside the seven scale tones,
      the chromatic ones open secondary dominants, modal mixture,
      Neapolitan, augmented sixths — every one of them a way to
      temporarily borrow a different key's gravity. Next: chromatic
      harmony.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 5 specific rules. Chrome lives in curriculum/index.astro. */

  /* Behold ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m5-behold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .m5-behold-track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }
  .m5-behold-step {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    min-width: 3.2rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.55rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    opacity: 0.45;
    transition:
      opacity 0.25s ease,
      border-color 0.25s ease,
      background 0.25s ease;
  }
  .m5-behold-step.active {
    opacity: 1;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.12);
  }
  .m5-step-roman {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m5-step-fn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m5-behold-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  /* Derive ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m5-derive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m5-fn-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .m5-fn-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }
  .m5-fn-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.1rem;
  }
  .m5-fn-short {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .m5-fn-name {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m5-fn-chords {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m5-fn-btn {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    min-width: 2.8rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m5-fn-btn:hover:not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m5-fn-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m5-fn-roman {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m5-fn-q {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .m5-fn-btn.active .m5-fn-q {
    color: var(--bg);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .m5-derive-caption {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    max-width: 44ch;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }

  /* Operate --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m5-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m5-slot-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m5-slot {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .m5-slot.ringing {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.1);
  }
  .m5-slot-fn {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m5-slot-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .m5-slot-btn {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.05rem;
    min-width: 2.2rem;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.4rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m5-slot-btn:hover:not(:disabled):not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m5-slot-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m5-slot-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .m5-slot-roman {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m5-slot-q {
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .m5-slot-btn.active .m5-slot-q {
    color: var(--bg);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .m5-operate-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m5-operate-play:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m5-operate-play:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    background: var(--bg-button);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .m5-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 46ch;
    line-height: 1.55 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .m5-fn-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
